  "description": "Beta: Fast pathfinding and game-AI SDK for real-time simulations with many moving agents. Bakes triangle navmeshes (flat, hierarchical, or multi-layer for ground/air/water) and routes single agents or whole goal-sharing swarms across them, reacts to dynamic obstacles without a full re-bake, and adds line-of-sight, fog-of-war, influence maps, congestion analysis, and spatial-hashed combat engagement for AI perception and tactics. Includes composable steering behaviors (Seek, Wander, Patrol, Flee, Queue, FlowLane) via a fluent Navigator, load-aware adaptive clustering for large populations, and a separate bake-free grid-tactics lane (tile line-of-sight, movement range, cover, target selection) for tile/square-grid games. Built on the EvalApp pipeline runtime for parallel, adaptively-tuned execution.",
  "id": "EvaluatedApplications.Tracer",
